  nonce: '1138'  # 1138
  message: "ADR-0062 (PR #1943) decided this item's open branch: on a CLI-vs-live conflict the op wins and the uncommitted live text is DROPPED with an awareness notice to the editor, not re-applied (re-applying would overwrite a change the editor cannot see). Commit points: title/description after 5 s idle per field; a draft on its explicit post flag -- never per keystroke (every op is an .ops line, which drives auto-sync). Refusals also cover locked_fields and frozen items."  # 1138
